      even in small amounts.
    ingredientIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eed61c787378b7643b7a9c0d2bc3b0fe, type: 3}
    silhouetteSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - ingredientId: shellfish
    ingredientName: Shellfish
    ingredientDescription: A common allergen that can cause severe reactions in sensitive
      individuals. Includes crustaceans like shrimp, crab, and lobster which can
      cause particularly strong reactions.
